---
import ServicePage from '../../components/services/ServicePage.astro';

export const prerender = true;

const canonical = 'https://busqueneil.com/hire/ai-engineer-nj';

const FAQ = [
  {
    q: 'Do you work on site in New Jersey?',
    a: "When it helps, yes. I can join a kickoff or a working session at your office in New Jersey, then handle the day-to-day build remotely. Most of the work doesn't need a room, so we meet when it's worth it.",
  },
  {
    q: 'Who does the work?',
    a: "I do. You talk to the person building it, from the first message to launch and after. There's no account manager in between.",
  },
  {
    q: 'How do you price the work?',
    a: 'A single build gets its own scope and price. Ongoing work is a monthly arrangement. Either way, you see the scope and price before any work starts.',
  },
];
---
<ServicePage
  title="AI Engineer in New Jersey | Neil Busque"
  description="Neil Busque is a New Jersey AI engineer building agents, automations and web apps for local and remote teams, on US Eastern time."
  canonical={canonical}
  active="hire"
  heading="Hire an **AI engineer in New Jersey**."
  lead="I'm Neil Busque, an AI engineer based in New Jersey. I build agents, automations and web apps for teams across the state, in person when it helps and remote when it doesn't."
  crumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: 'https://busqueneil.com/' },
    { name: 'Hire', url: 'https://busqueneil.com/hire' },
    { name: 'AI Engineer in New Jersey', url: canonical },
  ]}
  backLabel="When to hire me"
  topic="hiring an AI engineer in New Jersey"
  artSeed="hire-ai-engineer-nj"
  artPalette="mist"
  summary={{
    items: [
      'AI agents that answer leads and update your CRM',
      'Automations that take busywork off your team',
      'Custom web apps, with a first version in days',
      'Pages that get found in Google and AI search',
      'In-person meetings in New Jersey when they help',
    ],
    facts: [
      { term: 'Good for', value: 'New Jersey businesses that want a local builder' },
      { term: 'How it starts', value: 'A message, then a call or a meeting in person' },
      { term: 'What you own', value: 'The code and every account, in your name' },
    ],
  }}
  related={['agency-os-assistant-asks-first', 'crm-with-ai-follow-up']}
  relatedPalettes={['paper', 'navy']}
  faq={FAQ}
  service={{
    name: 'AI Engineer in New Jersey',
    serviceType: ['AI engineering', 'AI agent development', 'AI automation', 'Web app development'],
    areaServed: [
      { '@type': 'State', name: 'New Jersey' },
      { '@type': 'City', name: 'Newark' },
      { '@type': 'City', name: 'Jersey City' },
    ],
  }}
>
  <h2>Local, and same time zone</h2>
  <p>I'm based in the NJ and NYC metro and work on US Eastern time. I can join an in-person kickoff or a working session in Newark, Jersey City, the Princeton corridor or your office, then handle the day-to-day build remotely.</p>

  <h2>What I build for NJ companies</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>AI agents</strong> that answer leads, update your CRM and handle repetitive work. See <a href="/guides/build-ai-agent-claude-code">how I build them</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Automation</strong> in n8n, Zapier and GoHighLevel that takes the manual busywork off your team.</li>
    <li><strong>Custom web apps</strong>, with a working first version in days. Here is <a href="/guides/ship-web-app-in-days-with-ai">how</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>GEO and SEO</strong> so you get found in AI search and Google. See <a href="/guides/geo-for-local-business">GEO for local businesses</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>See the work first</h2>
  <p>In 2026 I shipped more than 40 apps, AI agents and automations, including operating systems for six agencies and service businesses that I still look after. Browse <a href="/work">the work</a> before you decide.</p>

  <h2>Hire me</h2>
  <p>Message me on WhatsApp, email <a href="mailto:busqueneil@gmail.com">busqueneil@gmail.com</a> or connect on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/neilbusque/" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>. Closer to the city? See <a href="/hire/ai-engineer-nyc">an AI engineer for NYC teams</a> or <a href="/hire/ai-engineer-remote">a remote AI engineer</a>. More on <a href="/hire">when to bring me in</a>.</p>
</ServicePage>
